+# Substantive author turn 2
+
+This turn tested the infinite syzygy/endotrivial route to a counterexample. It identifies the entire closed stable endotrivial span with a weighted l¹ algebra of the stable endotrivial group. The credited gamma-one theorem forces every bounded character to be unitary, giving its exact Fourier spectrum and symmetry. It also proves invariance of the duality defect under an endotrivial twist.
